
button, badge, link, image and the components that render generically all have
declared android bodies, and nothing in compose_ir.go is keyed on any of their
names -- so what this fixture pins is the override bodies themselves, and a
body deleted or rewritten in lib/platforms/android/android.sngl fails here.

button is a Button whose onClick is the @click handler's body and whose child
is a Text of `text`. The label goes through the declared Text intrinsic, so it
is a named `text =` argument and not a positional one, and an unwired button
still gets a lambda because Compose's onClick is not optional. badge wraps its
`value` in Badge, and the style reaches Badge's modifier. link is a Text
carrying the theme's primary colour, which Style has no field for and the
override therefore spells in Kotlin via `args`.

The rest state what android does today rather than what it might: image is an
unsized Spacer, chip renders its label as bare text,
toolbar/popover/drawer/tooltip/splitview are a Column over their children, and
menubar and avatar have neither children nor a text prop the override could
show, so both are an empty Text.

deny out/kotlin/android/MainScreen.kt `TODO: Image` -- an unimplemented widget draws a Spacer, it does not leave a marker in the output
deny out/kotlin/android/MainScreen.kt `Image\(` -- image's android body is a Spacer; no Compose Image composable is reached
deny out/kotlin/android/MainScreen.kt `unknown` -- every component here has a declared android body, so nothing falls through to a placeholder
deny out/kotlin/android/MainScreen.kt `AssistChip` -- chip is bare text; the override names no Material chip
deny out/kotlin/android/MainScreen.kt `DropdownMenu` -- the menu-like components are a plain Column, not a Compose menu surface
-- app.sngl --
import . "sngl:ui"
import . "sngl:dialog"

output {
    kotlin {
        android
    }
}

component main node {
    var n = 0

    vbox {
        button(style={padding=4}, text="bump", @click { n += 1 })
        button(text="quiet")
        badge(style={padding=6}, value="7")
        link(href="/", text="Home")
        image(src="/logo.png", alt="logo")
        chip(label="Tag")
        toolbar(style={padding=9}) {
            button(text="New")
        }
        menubar(items=["File"])
        avatar(initials="JD")
    }
}

window {
    main
}
